{
  "info": {
    "name": "TopupLedger",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "TopupLedger B2B Mobile Top-up API.\n\nEnvironment variables required:\n- baseUrl           (e.g. http://localhost:8080)\n- partnerApiKey     (e.g. pk_test_acme_001)\n- partnerSecret     (e.g. sk_test_EJ3NS3_UAE_2026_k7Rm - shown once at creation)\n- adminApiKey       (e.g. dev-admin-api-key)\n- etisalatToken     (e.g. dev-operator-token-etisalat)\n- duToken           (e.g. dev-operator-token-du)\n\nThe pre-request script computes the X-Signature header using HMAC-SHA256 over:\n  METHOD\\nPATH\\nX-Timestamp\\nIdempotency-Key\\nSHA256(rawBody)\n\nIt uses the raw request body bytes (Postman's pm.request.body.raw) - do NOT reformat\nthe JSON body or the signature will not match."
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "partnerApiKey", "value": "pk_test_acme_001" },
    { "key": "partnerSecret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SECRET_SHOWN_AT_PARTNER_CREATION" },
    { "key": "adminApiKey", "value": "dev-admin-api-key" },
    { "key": "etisalatToken", "value": "dev-operator-token-etisalat" },
    { "key": "duToken", "value": "dev-operator-token-du" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// === HMAC-SHA256 pre-request script for TopupLedger partner API ===",
          "// Computes X-Signature over METHOD\\nPATH\\nX-Timestamp\\nIdempotency-Key\\nSHA256(rawBody).",
          "// The body SHA256 is computed from the RAW body bytes exactly as Postman will send them;",
          "// do not reformat the JSON body or the signature will not match.",
          "",
          "const method = pm.request.method;",
          "const url = new URL(pm.request.url.toString());",
          "const path = url.pathname;  // excludes query string and host",
          "",
          "// X-Timestamp: unix seconds, UTC, must be within +/- 300s of server time.",
          "const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
          "",
          "// Idempotency-Key: required for POST. Generate a fresh UUID per request.",
          "let idemKey = pm.request.headers.get('Idempotency-Key');",
          "if (method === 'POST' && !idemKey) {",
          "  idemKey = pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}');",
          "  pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Idempotency-Key', value: idemKey });",
          "}",
          "idemKey = idemKey || '';",
          "",
          "// Body SHA256. For GET, hash of empty string.",
          "let body = '';",
          "if (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.raw) {",
          "  body = pm.request.body.raw;",
          "}",
          "const bodySha256 = CryptoJS.SHA256(body).toString();  // CryptoJS is built-in to Postman",
          "",
          "// Build string-to-sign (no trailing newline).",
          "const stringToSign = [method, path, timestamp, idemKey, bodySha256].join('\\n');",
          "",
          "// HMAC-SHA256 with the partner secret.",
          "const secret = pm.variables.get('partnerSecret');",
          "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(stringToSign, secret).toString();  // lowercase hex",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Api-Key', value: pm.variables.get('partnerApiKey') });",
          "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Timestamp', value: timestamp });",
          "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Signature', value: signature });",
          "",
          "// Helpful debug: log what we signed (do NOT log the secret).",
          "console.log('String-to-sign:', JSON.stringify(stringToSign));",
          "console.log('Body SHA256:', bodySha256);",
          "console.log('Signature:', signature);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create top-up",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/topups",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"msisdn\":\"0501234567\",\"amount\":\"25.00\",\"operator\":\"ETISALAT\",\"clientRef\":\"RTL-000981\"}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get top-up by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/topups/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List top-ups (keyset pagination)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/topups?limit=20&status=PENDING"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Wallet balance + last 20 ledger entries",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/wallet"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get settlement for business day",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/settlements/2026-10-12"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Operator callbacks (separate auth)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "etisalat callback - SUCCESS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Operator-Token', value: pm.variables.get('etisalatToken') });",
                  "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/callbacks/etisalat",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"operatorTxnId\":\"ETS-TEST-1\",\"topupId\":1,\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "du callback - FAILED",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Operator-Token', value: pm.variables.get('duToken') });",
                  "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/operator/callbacks/du",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"operatorTxnId\":\"DU-TEST-2\",\"topupId\":2,\"status\":\"FAILED\"}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reports (X-Admin-Key auth)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": ["pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Admin-Key', value: pm.variables.get('adminApiKey') });"]
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        { "name": "1. Daily summary", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/daily-summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "2. Operators", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/operators?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "3. Partners top", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/partners/top?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12&limit=10" } },
        { "name": "4. Commission", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/commission?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "5. Wallets as-of", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/wallets?asOf=2026-10-12T12:00:00Z" } },
        { "name": "6. Wallet statement", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/wallets/1/statement?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "7. Hourly", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/hourly?businessDay=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "8. Failures", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/failures?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "9. Reconciliation files", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/reconciliation?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-12" } },
        { "name": "10. Inactive partners", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/partners/inactive?days=7" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health" }
    }
  ]
}
